1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,680
System boots: sensors, task zones, and five-finger hand come online.

2
00:00:07,680 --> 00:00:16,000
Visual servoing aligns the palm to the medicine vial under pose disturbance.

3
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:24,320
Five fingers close with contact-balanced grip, protecting the fragile vial.

4
00:00:24,320 --> 00:00:35,200
Wrist roll and thumb opposition rotate the cap while the vial stays stable.

5
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:44,800
The hand carries the vial to the sterile pod with residual corrections active.

6
00:00:44,800 --> 00:00:52,480
Delivery is confirmed only after the audit button is pressed.

7
00:00:52,480 --> 00:00:59,520
A slip impulse is observed and corrected before release.

8
00:00:59,520 --> 00:01:04,000
The run exports video, trajectory, policy card, stress eval, and judge brief.
